NimbyDpv (DPV, working name) - original work by Jeff Fabish for NIMBY | HARDCORE | BADLANDS | 1pp.

Phase 0 (November 5, 2026): a config-only vehicle class, NimbyDpv_TestCar, that inherits the
vanilla DayZ 1.30 OffroadHatchback (Bohemia Interactive) and reuses its model, parts, sounds,
and physics unchanged, so the pack can prove on the local test server that a NIMBY vehicle
class spawns, is entered, drives, and persists on 1.30 before a model is bought. No vanilla
asset is copied into the pack; the class points at the vanilla model path through inheritance.

Planned model (not yet acquired, not in this addon): "Desert Patrol Vehicle Low-poly" by carbuni,
CGTrader model 1875658, Royalty Free License. When it lands, this NOTICE records the vendor,
license, purchase date, and the shared rules 9.3 exception for the model source
(docs/design/dpv-feasibility.md, D-2).

